Subject: [PATCH] docs: clarify the MCP and CLI migration plan scope

Exempt Hexalith.Builds workspace tooling that never invokes module
operations, limit retained implementations to only safety and continuity
fixes, and publish plan 1.1.0 with its versioning and inventory coverage
rules.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
